			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">The young caster smiles and looks to the lady, &quot;Nay good lady, I know not exactly where he is. I was too caught up in the moment. What I do know is this, he was heading towards the realms of southern Ro desert as he turned his path towards the pass that was made within the walls of the cliffs. I have heard rumor that he was planning to assault the house of Innoruk himself... How he planned to do that I have no good idea, I have only read that there are ways to venture into that dark realm but only the strongest of adventuring teams would travel into such a place.&quot; he sighs.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;I can only pray that he shall return victorious in whatever endevor he takes upon himself. I hope Mithaniel Marr watches over him with honour.&quot; He smiles.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;I would take heart good lady I have seen him do combat and I know that no normal beast or creature shall be able to best him.&quot; he raises his glass once again, &quot;However if you wish to track him I would suggest asking the gypsies in the oasis of marr... They might know where he is.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Rithnok Tatsukao Flamespewer
