				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=15899&amp;sid=3ec44e9b483f47e22a412dc9eb10dc54#15899"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Tue Sep 03, 2002 6:48 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=15899&amp;sid=3ec44e9b483f47e22a412dc9eb10dc54"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Marcelas listens to the tale only partially paying attention, having heard many tales in many taverns... until... The name Rithnok is mentioned.  He suddenly turns his full attention to the elf and listens in wonderment.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
At the end he smiles and raises his glass in praise to the warrior who stood against Lucan.  &quot;Amazing!&quot; is the breathless word that escapes his mouth before turning his brandy up. 
<br />
Marcelas Hiddenstrike
<br />

<br />
Scout of the Concordat
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
<i></i><br />_________________<br />The good thing about repeating your mistakes is that you know when to duck.</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
