		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=15900&amp;sid=3ec44e9b483f47e22a412dc9eb10dc54#15900"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Tue Sep 03, 2002 8:38 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=15900&amp;sid=3ec44e9b483f47e22a412dc9eb10dc54"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">The elf looks puzzled for a second, &quot;I would nae know good sir... I can only speak of what I have seen. for all I know with the powers I have...&quot; he points to the door, &quot;For all I know he could walk into the tavern right now.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
*CREAK* the door opens as quietly the Iksarian samurai walks through he looks around for a second at all those looking at him he speaks quietly, &quot;good eve to you all I trust the eve goes well?&quot; nothing... just stark utter silence greets the samurai as he enters, he looks around again as if trying to figure out what he has just walked into.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;Was it something I said?&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
He asks before walking towards the bar, &quot;Indalis? a cup of coffee please? For a tired and weary samurai?&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Rithnok Tatsukao Flamespewer
<br />

<br />
High Master of Dragons, Shogun of the 56th rank
<br />

<br />
Guardians of Honor
<br />

<br />
Test Server 
<br />
