				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=15904&amp;sid=3ec44e9b483f47e22a412dc9eb10dc54#15904"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Wed Sep 04, 2002 7:52 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
