				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">&quot;You've got it.&quot;  The old barbarian smiles as he pours the cup of coffee and set it in front of the warrior.  &quot;By the gods... Samurai of Norrath now eh?  Quite impressive old friend.&quot;  
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
He seems to mull something over in his mind for a few minutes as if a miniature battle rages inside him.  Finally he faces the open tavern and his booming voice rings out a message that few if any have ever heard come from the old barkeep.  &quot;Let's drink again to Rithnok!  Drinks on me!&quot;  Then in a quieter voice, &quot;...one round.&quot; 
<br />
