				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">With the sudden cheers erupting around her, Nimui raises her eyes from the letter she's reading.  Seeing the rounds go out, she gratefully accepts a glass and raises it high to Rithnok.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;Congratulations Sir.  You truly are the Samurai of Norrath.&quot; she cries out with cheer and full admiration. 
