		<td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=15908&amp;sid=3ec44e9b483f47e22a412dc9eb10dc54#15908"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Wed Sep 04, 2002 1:00 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=15908&amp;sid=3ec44e9b483f47e22a412dc9eb10dc54"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Rithnok looks around in stark astonishment, his eyes telling of the sheer surprise that wells up from within his very soul. Tis not often that a samurai is caught off guard but from the words spoken to his praise he can do nothing but be ever so humble with the cheers from those around him... Those who he has called &quot;friend.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
He raises his mug to acknowledge the cheers from those within the bar, he takes a moment raising a clawed hand to calm the happy crowd, as silence finally falls he quietly speaks.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;This title, this name I have earned within the eyes of Norrath, tis not anymore than a way to inspire those of younger years. To reach for things that they think themselves unattainable. To try when they think all to be lost. To stand against the Tsunami which is darkness. This is what my title means to others. To me, it is a confirmation of what I have already known for so long. I need no god...&quot; he bows his head speaking such a thing. &quot;To tell me who I am. Only I need to know who I am... And if I don't? Then I am naught much more than a bragart attempting to be that which he is not. So listen to my words to those who would. Let the lands have their titles, let others think you are some being of great import because of your name. But never... NEVER forget who you are and where your roots are... For without those, you shall ot find nourishment. Remember keep your friend and family closer than all others.&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
He smiles and bows his head, &quot;I am honoured by your praise my friends. And I am equally honoured to call you, 'family' for like a family you have all been there through my failures and victories. Either with kind reassurance, a good gesture, even a smile, and in some cases, even a stiff slap for using words that I thought even rogues might blush at.&quot; he chuckles.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
&quot;So here I say!&quot; he raises his mug, &quot;Tis not to me this praise should go, but to those who have stood by me. For without them I may not have had the strength to do the things I have done. Memory! To those who have fallen before us. Strength to those who stand against the darkness, and Cheers! To the Concordant Angelis! For above all else stands this family of Honour and Friendship!&quot;
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
With that the samurai lifts his mug to his jaws and drinks deeply of the hot murky liquid.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Rithnok Tatsukao Flamespewer
<br />

<br />
High Master of Dragons, Shogun of the 56th Rank
<br />

<br />
Guardians of Honor
<br />

<br />
Test Server 
<br />
