			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Having sat quietly, listening to and watching those at the inn while she sips her mead, Morani suddenly breaks into laughter at in timing of Rithnok’s entrance. As each toast goes by, she raises her glass with everyone else. 
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
After the Samurai finishes speaking, she walks over to him and bows deeply with respect. “Congratulations on your victory and the door it opened for you.” Dropping the formally, she smiles and gives him a hug. “It was nice of you to come back in one piece and not leaking like a goblin bucket.”
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
 
<br />
